<title>USA: Coachmen says Skinner to be chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Coachmen says Skinner to be chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coachmen Industries Inc said vice chairman Claire Skinner will become chairman and chief executive officer on August 1, when current chairman and CEO Thomas Corson plans to retire.</p>
<p>In the interim, Skinner, 42, has been designated chairman-elect, said the recreational vehicles maker.</p>
<p>Corson, 69, will be chairman emeritus after retirement.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
